        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are the moving charges calculated for a house shift from Chhatarpur to a major transport hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Charges are based on a transparent matrix that considers total volume (in cubic feet), distance (≈850 km), truck type (18‑ft, 22‑ft, or 32‑ft MX), and any special handling such as piano or vehicle transport. Additional factors include stair‑case access, packing material selection, and optional insurance upgrades. The cost matrix displayed on the page breaks down each component for full clarity.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Which documents are required for inter‑city relocation and reimbursement claims in Chhatarpur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID, GST‑registered invoice from Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers, the e‑Way bill generated for the cargo, and a signed delivery receipt at the destination. For corporate or government reimbursements, submit the original invoice, e‑Way bill, and insurance certificate to the finance department for processing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time while it moves from Chhatarpur to the destination hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every truck is equipped with a satellite‑GPS unit linked to our live‑tracking portal. Once the move is scheduled, you receive a unique tracking ID. By entering this ID on our website or mobile app, you can monitor the vehicle’s exact location, estimated arrival time, and any checkpoint updates in real time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What special precautions are taken when moving a two‑wheeler or car from Chhatarpur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Two‑wheelers and cars are loaded onto dedicated enclosed trailers fitted with hydraulic ramps, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Each vehicle is secured at four points, and a pre‑move inspection checklist documents existing scratches or dents. The cargo is then covered with weather‑proof stretch film and monitored via CCTV throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Why is IBA approval important when selecting packers and movers in Chhatarpur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The Indian Banks Association (IBA) approval signifies that the mover adheres to a strict code of conduct, financial solvency, and transparent billing practices. This accreditation reassures banks and corporate clients that the company can reliably handle reimbursement claims, provide audited invoices, and maintain high service standards, reducing the risk of fraud or hidden fees.</p>
